desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Bokeh Deprecated Apis"
	title_zh: "Bokeh Deprecated Apis"
	type: maintainability
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-maintainability-bokeh-deprecated-apis"
	risk: "code-style"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from rule `bokeh-deprecated-apis` (python/bokeh/maintainability/deprecated/deprecated_apis.yaml).
Original message: These APIs are deprecated in Bokeh see https://docs.bokeh.org/en/latest/docs/releases.html#api-deprecations
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review this occurrence and replace it with a safer alternative.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
import bokeh.layouts.widgetbox
POS
	"safefile://pos.py": <<<NEG
import bokeh.plotting
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+bokeh\.layouts\.widgetbox)|(?:import\s+bokeh\.models\.graphs\.from_networkx)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Bokeh Deprecated Apis",
	title_zh: "Bokeh Deprecated Apis",
	message: "Bokeh Deprecated Apis detected.",
}
